# Example targets file - copy to targets.txt (single link, NUM_LINKS=1) or to
# targets01.txt, targets02.txt, ... (one per link when NUM_LINKS>1 in .env).
# The real targets*.txt files are gitignored so each install keeps its own list.
#
# One host (IP or name) per line. Anything after # is ignored, so comment a
# line out to stop monitoring it. After editing, run: bat_many_ping.bat restart
8.8.8.8     # Google DNS
1.1.1.1     # Cloudflare DNS
#9.9.9.9    # Quad9 DNS
#8.8.4.4    # Google DNS secondary
#192.168.1.1 # your gateway/router
